  "bio": "Aces Over Eights Tattoo, nestled in the heart of Petaluma, has been a beacon of traditional tattoo artistry in Sonoma County since 2011. Our studio exudes a warm, vintage atmosphere where old-school design meets modern professionalism, ensuring each client leaves with a timeless masterpiece. Come join us at Aces Over Eights Tattoo, where tradition is inked with passion and precision.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Petaluma, California, United States\n\nLOCATED IN THE ♥️ OF PETALUMA CA\nEst. 2011 • Walk-Ins Welcome •  Closed Mondays\n🇺🇸🇵🇭🏳️‍🌈🇨🇴🇬🇧🇲🇽🇵🇷🇨🇦🇧🇷🇨🇱🇸🇩🇲🇶🇫🇲🇲🇲\nIt’s an honor to service our community!",
